This fork: https://github.com/anonamerjaxon-dev/dsh-cad
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Modifications made in this fork (see the commit history for the full list):

  * Dark-mode support: themed viewport, scene grid/edges and panel surfaces.

The modeling tool family (OCCT kernel, STEP/STL/IGES/DXF import/export) is
unchanged from upstream.

